# The test has BFS_step_impl and BFS_step functions.
# BFS_step_impl is always vectorized, BFS_step only calls
# BFS_step_impl.
#
# We want BFS_step to be vectorized, but if the
# allocas used to store the arguments are not removed
# (the allocas come from inlining), the vectorizer won’t
# be able to do it.
#
# The test passes if both in BFS_step_impl and BFS_step
# the loop is vectorized.
CHECK: {{^}}vector.body

